        "f1": "The drone orthomosaic worker takes stitching jobs from vld-ortho-q-shale. Jobs include a flight manifest reference and the source imagery location.",
        "f2": "On 2026-02-19, the drone orthomosaic worker switched to vld-ortho-q-briar so long-running stitching jobs would not block quick previews in the previous queue."
